00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.234
F4.2 · What you never do in a client tenant

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.663
Never share a login, approve your own change or type over a figure.

3
00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:14.072
Test in your lab; controls change only on the client's written decision.

4
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.487
An hour of delay is always cheaper than an unexplained change.

5
00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:30.397
That completes Foundation. Next comes the exam: setting up Halden Trading.

